From af0b2fd2b53970ada1e7f19b1d25bf452fb5d851 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 17:32:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: Twitch through Streamlink without the ad breaks; the
 Twitch sign-in and followed channels

When Streamlink is installed, a Twitch channel plays through it (its
output piped to mpv), as Streamlink Twitch GUI plays it: Streamlink
leaves Twitch's ad breaks out. a2.video.twitch gains account, login
(twitch.tv's auth-token, kept in twitch.json in the meter's folder),
logout and followed (the signed-in player's followed channels).
---
